== CANON-18/CANON-19 (r3.63): Std.Debug.Assert does nothing when its
== condition holds; the message is evaluated in order with the condition.
Module Runtime.DebugAssertHolds

Use Std.Debug

Main :
    Total := 3
    Assert(Total > 0)
    Assert(Total = 3, "Total must be 3")
    PutLn("ok ", Total)
;
